Haas stereo enhancer (src/audio/haas.ts)

src/audio/haas.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_haas.c: the AVOption table
(names, defaults and ranges of level_in, level_out, side_gain, middle_source,
middle_phase, left/right delay, balance, gain and phase), query_formats (a
single packed dbl format and the stereo layout), config_input (delay
truncation to uint32 samples, phase signs and balance coefficients) and the
per-sample loop of filter_frame.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
